<section class="py-section-padding bg-surface-container-lowest border-y border-surface-variant">
    <div class="max-w-container-max-width mx-auto px-gutter">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-white mb-4">Mais que LISP, <span class="text-primary-container">uma central de ferramentas</span></h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Expanda as capacidades do seu ambiente CAD com bibliotecas visuais gerenciadas pela nuvem e ferramentas de personalização de interface.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-[#262626] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="h-64 overflow-hidden relative border-b border-[#262626]">
                    <img alt="Hatch Pattern Library Pro" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/ADBb0ujBheElLlQnYDoytomVyN1XeRppy9BWnbhYUBjgA_C3A4klYEoAR4_3q6zqHesCl5be24xxHynbDJVmAgN6uEB2V0jVOaK9aMnJj_j5USCHsx3dwjBTLR2MoyZyQPNcxMteB2S8zuy0PUoY68GyOS3MsO7RJ6HxRmyHZVzEhQ0LVgeo26THQ0w0djOFnKntOvLFDS1yBM4t5q_M3lLjGZVzekaETsRtII2zhqe8vf7G4O-JVLALoBuOJg"/>
                </div>
                <div class="p-8">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">grid_view</span>
                        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white">Hatch Library</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
                        Sincronize centenas de padrões de hachura personalizados para toda a empresa instantaneamente. Evite a perda de tempo procurando arquivos .pat perdidos.
                    </p>
                    <a class="text-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md font-bold hover:text-[#e66000] flex items-center gap-2" href="#">
                        Explorar Hachuras <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-[#262626] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="h-64 overflow-hidden relative border-b border-[#262626] bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center">
                    <img alt="Line Type Library" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/ADBb0uipfO9F9v3uY99ouDrhjp2Zna6RUwlmeONVRuEV2JuJ6JtBQfXFPElM2Q4FDs769bb5yffoaOjIPMKcefqZW7_eZUq_gbxa5bBWQi2WA1EcyZYHIbRu6_0j3MWd4Ip1PzlExjYFibGvmocn1G5Fcee7he76liqvDzLPGyHiyruukkQZrNnXHxylsJQVoPkpFP6LCTvOWahDapl1YejMBwEHiTqJa5TW3ASpQvq4xrmrPbcUGXExaZM1rWM"/>
                </div>
                <div class="p-8">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container">horizontal_rule</span>
                        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white">Line Library</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
                        Padronize os tipos de linha de todos os projetos. Distribua bibliotecas de linhas complexas globalmente com controle de versão rigoroso.
                    </p>
                    <a class="text-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md font-bold hover:text-[#e66000] flex items-center gap-2" href="#">
                        Ver Tipos de Linha <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
